 "remarks": "Public Wine Bar - Turnkey Business Opportunity in SoNo - Owner Financing Available  Established for eight years, Public Wine Bar is an operating wine bar and restaurant at 88 Washington Street in the heart of South Norwalk, Connecticut's dining and entertainment district.  The lease includes the equipped restaurant space, restaurant equipment, and furniture needed to keep the business operating-all included in the monthly rent. The bar glass washer is the only separately leased equipment. Rent is locked in through 2033, then adjusts to market rate.  The sale includes 100% of the ownership interests in HCMD, LLC, the operating company that holds the existing cafe liquor permit and music and entertainment licensing. Continue the current concept or bring your own menu, programming, and vision.  Owner financing available. Business financials, lease details, and equipment information are available to qualified buyers.  Ownership change is subject to applicable regulatory approvals and any required landlord consent. No real estate is included.",
